# Allowlist: ignore everything, then let in only what the build needs.
# This keeps secrets (.env), build output (bin/, obj/), git history and
# old helper scripts out of the image. If you add a new top-level source
# folder, add a "!folder/" line for it below or the build won't see it.
*

!MusicDatabase.csproj
!Program.cs
!Startup.cs
!appsettings.json

!Controllers/
!Data/
!Migrations/
!Models/
!Services/
!Views/
!wwwroot/

# never, even if a pattern above would match:
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.env
**/.DS_Store
